#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.5.1.rst:4
msgid "v3.5.1"
msgstr "v3.5.1"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.5.1.rst:6
msgid ""
"v3.5.1 fixes the TensorFlow ``conv2d`` / ``sepconv3`` operations, updates "
"TensorFlow and :mod:`ulab`, and improves image-format error messages. It "
"introduces **no breaking API changes** — v3.5.0 scripts run unchanged."
msgstr ""
"v3.5.1 ispravlja TensorFlow ``conv2d`` / ``sepconv3`` operacije, ažurira "
"TensorFlow i :mod:`ulab` te poboljšava poruke o pogreškama formata slike. Ne"
" uvodi **nikakve promjene API-ja koje narušavaju kompatibilnost** — skripte "
"za v3.5.0 rade nepromijenjene."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.5.1.rst:13
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "Na ovoj stranici"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.5.1.rst:16
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "Istaknuto"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.5.1.rst:18
msgid ""
"**TensorFlow fixes** — corrected ``conv2d`` and ``sepconv3`` boundary "
"handling, plus a TensorFlow update."
msgstr ""
"**TensorFlow ispravci** — ispravljeno rukovanje granicama za ``conv2d`` i "
"``sepconv3``\\ , uz ažuriranje TensorFlowa."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.5.1.rst:20
msgid "**Clearer errors** — more specific image-format error messages."
msgstr "**Jasnije pogreške** — preciznije poruke o pogreškama formata slike."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.5.1.rst:21
msgid ""
"**No breaking API changes** — reflash and your v3.5.0 scripts run unchanged."
msgstr ""
"**Bez promjena API-ja koje narušavaju kompatibilnost** — ponovno flashajte i"
" vaše skripte za v3.5.0 rade nepromijenjene."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.5.1.rst:25
msgid "Other changes and improvements"
msgstr "Ostale promjene i poboljšanja"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.5.1.rst:27
msgid ""
"Updated TensorFlow and :mod:`ulab`; disabled :mod:`ulab` on the OpenMV 2 "
"(M4, which lacks the space for it) and the WiFi debug feature on older "
"boards (especially the OpenMV 3); removed unused submodules; updated the "
"WiFi firmware-update script."
msgstr ""
"Ažurirani TensorFlow i :mod:`ulab`\\ ; onemogućen :mod:`ulab` na OpenMV 2 "
"(M4, koji nema prostora za njega) i WiFi debug značajka na starijim pločama "
"(osobito OpenMV 3); uklonjeni nekorišteni podmoduli; ažurirana skripta za "
"ažuriranje WiFi ugrađenog programa (firmware)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.5.1.rst:33
msgid "Bug fixes"
msgstr "Ispravci grešaka"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.5.1.rst:35
msgid "Machine learning:"
msgstr "Strojno učenje:"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.5.1.rst:37
msgid ""
"Fixed the TensorFlow library ``conv2d`` and ``sepconv3`` boundary handling."
msgstr ""
"Ispravljeno rukovanje granicama za ``conv2d`` i ``sepconv3`` u TensorFlow "
"knjižnici."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.5.1.rst:39
msgid "Imaging:"
msgstr "Obrada slike:"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.5.1.rst:41
msgid ""
"Fixed the ``mutable_bayer`` error message and made image-format errors more "
"specific."
msgstr ""
"Ispravljena poruka o pogrešci ``mutable_bayer`` te su pogreške formata slike"
" učinjene preciznijima."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.5.1.rst:44
msgid "System:"
msgstr "Sustav:"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.5.1.rst:46
msgid "Fixed debug-build linker errors."
msgstr "Ispravljene pogreške povezivača (linker) za debug build."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.5.1.rst:49
msgid "Breaking API changes"
msgstr "Promjene API-ja koje narušavaju kompatibilnost"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.5.1.rst:51
msgid ""
"v3.5.1 introduces **no breaking Python API changes**. Scripts that ran on "
"v3.5.0 run unchanged on v3.5.1 — just reflash the firmware. (Note: "
":mod:`ulab` is not available on the OpenMV 2 due to its limited flash.)"
msgstr ""
"v3.5.1 ne uvodi **nikakve promjene Python API-ja koje narušavaju "
"kompatibilnost**\\ . Skripte koje su radile na v3.5.0 rade nepromijenjene na"
" v3.5.1 — samo ponovno flashajte ugrađeni program (firmware). (Napomena: "
":mod:`ulab` nije dostupan na OpenMV 2 zbog njegove ograničene flash "
"memorije.)"
